    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849669
    m_Localized: Open AprilTag PDF generator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849670
    m_Localized: Use multiple tags with different IDs. Mount them securely around
      the space, especially at the farthest edges and corners. Keep them visible
      from the play area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849671
    m_Localized: "Connect the PC and headset to the same local network. In the headset,
      open Connection \u2192 Connect manually. Turn off Connect over the internet
      and enter this PC's IP address."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849672
    m_Localized: No local IP address available
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849673
    m_Localized: Put on a connected headset. Its hand palette will guide you through
      measuring the inner white square and registering tags. Register several different
      IDs around the space, then return here to review.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849674
    m_Localized: Check the tag positions and directions in the viewport against the
      room. Cyan squares mark registered tags; yellow lines show their direction.
      Confirm the IDs and coverage at the farthest edges. Use a headset to register
      any missing tags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849675
    m_Localized: Show all tags in viewport
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849676
    m_Localized: I checked the tag layout and coverage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849677
    m_Localized: Finish saves the setup and returns connected headsets to normal
      play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849678
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849679
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849680
    m_Localized: Confirm and finish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849681
    m_Localized: Stop setup
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849682
    m_Localized: "{0} connected headset(s) \xB7 {1} registered tag(s)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 533178702104363357
  - m_Id: 1355627396849683
    m_Localized: Waiting for a headset. Registration starts automatically when it
      joins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849684
    m_Localized: Follow the measurement guide in the headset before registering tags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849685
    m_Localized: Register tags in the headset. Keep looking at each tag until its
      registration appears here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849686
    m_Localized: No tags registered yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849687
    m_Localized: Wait for a headset to align with the registered tags before finishing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849688
    m_Localized: Start hosting on the PC before setting up AprilTags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849689
    m_Localized: Create or select a space first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849690
    m_Localized: Wait for the current map operation to finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849691
    m_Localized: The setup could not be saved. Check storage and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849692
    m_Localized: Measure the inner white square in the headset before registering
      tags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849693
    m_Localized: 1. Measure the inner white square, not the black frame. Place the
      right controller's ruler tip at one corner and press the trigger. Move along
      one edge to the adjacent corner and press again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849694
    m_Localized: Keep the headset on and tracked. The PC assigns one headset to measure
      and register the first tag. Other headsets can help after looking at a registered
      tag to align.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849695
    m_Localized: 2. Look at a tag, aim at it with the right controller, and press
      the trigger. Keep looking until the registered count updates. Repeat with different
      IDs around the room, especially at its farthest edges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1355627396849696
    m_Localized: "{0} registered tag(s) \xB7 inner white square: {1:0.0} cm"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 533178702104363357
  - m_Id: 1355627396849697
    m_Localized: When all tags are registered, return to the PC to check the layout
      and finish. This headset returns to normal play when the operator finishes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
